{# AO · THE IDENTITY FACTS, DEMOTED.

   These used to be four KPI plates at the top of this page, which told an area manager that the
   first question of the morning is how many square kilometres the area has. It is not, and it has
   not changed since it was gazetted. One quiet band, one line, and the link to where the facts are
   managed — and it is a widget like any other, which is why "Attention queue" is allowed to sink
   it to the foot of the page.

   A fact the app does not record is simply not a field here. #}
<div class="ao-ident">
    <span class="f"><span class="k">Area</span><span class="v">{{ by.host.areaKm2|number_format }}<em>km²</em></span></span>
    <span class="f"><span class="k">Zones</span><span class="v">{{ by.host.zoneCount }}<em>{{ by.host.zoneCount ? 'presence-driven' : 'none yet' }}</em></span></span>
    {% if by.host.iucn %}<span class="f"><span class="k">IUCN</span><span class="v">{{ by.host.iucn }}</span></span>{% endif %}
    {% if by.host.established %}<span class="f"><span class="k">Established</span><span class="v">{{ by.host.established }}</span></span>{% endif %}
    {% if by.host.centroid %}<span class="f"><span class="k">Centroid</span><span class="v">{{ by.host.centroid }}</span></span>{% endif %}
    <span class="sp"></span>
    <a class="more" href="{{ urls.settings }}">Area settings →</a>
</div>
